// Epoch starts at zero; each reset increments it exactly once. IDs restart at
// zero in the new epoch. No page referencing the old epoch may follow a reset.
// Client-initiated resets carry the request ID and are followed by completion;
// server-initiated resets have no ID and need no acknowledgement from the client.
